                      SCSI STANDARD SENSE DATA   

  0      Val -r7(0)   Error Code -r0(70)
  1      (00)
  2      -r7(0)   -r6(0)   ILI -r5(0)   -r4(0)   Sense Key -r0(5)
 3-6     Information (00 00 00 00)
  7      Additional Sense Length (78)
 8-11    Command Specific Information (00 00 00 00)
  12     Array Additional Sense Code (00)
  13     ASCQ (00)
  14     FRU (00)
15-17    SKSV -r7(0)   Sense Key Specific Bytes -r0(0) (00 00) 
18-19    Recovery Actions (00 00)
  20     Total Number of Errors (00)
  21     Total Retry Count (00)
22-25    ASC/ASCQ STack (00 00 00 00)
26-30    Additional FRU Information (00 00 00 00)
31-32    Chip Specific Information (00 00)
33-36    Error Detection Point (00 00 00 00)
37-40    Reserved (00 00 00 00)
41-50    Original CDB (00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00)
  51     Host ID (00)
  52     Host Descriptor (00)
53-68    Array Board Serial # (00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00)
69-72    Array Appliction Firmware Level (00 00 00 00)
  73     RAID Configuration (00)
  74     RAID Operation (00)
  75     LUN Number (00)
  76     LUN Status (00)
  77     Drive Identifier (00)
  78     Transfer Start Drive ID (00)
 79-82   Disk Transfer Start LBA (00 00 00 00)
 83-98   Drive Product ID "                "
 99-100  Array Power Up Status (00 00) 
101-102  Array Sense Block ID (00 00)
103-108  Reserved (00 00 00 00 00 00)
  109    Drive Sense ID (00)
110-127  Drive Standard Sense Data (00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00)

